{"2026.5.8:P02-Q01":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>湖南非遗与食品文物化学</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 麓山国际四月学情调研 · 原题1 · P02-Q01</div><h1>湖南非遗与食品文物化学</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学与STSE/化学科学对人类文明发展的意义</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：联系蚕丝、电子跃迁、酿酒和碳同位素年代测定。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/蛋白质 核酸</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/核外电子分布及运动</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/糖类</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应基本概念</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/原子的构成结构</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;\" style=\"width:434.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>1. 湖南山水奇秀、文化底蕴深厚。下列与化学有关的说法正确的是</p><p>A. 马王堆汉墓出土的直裾素纱禅衣是西汉蚕丝制品，主要成分为纤维素</p><p>B. 浏阳花炮的历史可溯至唐宋，烟花是电子由基态跃迁到激发态释放能量而产生</p><p>C. 湘西非物质文化遗产酒鬼酒，酿酒过程涉及氧化还原反应</p><p>D. 城头山古文化遗址被誉为“中国最早城市”，可利用<img src=\"chem-asset:a8ab8898e0dd09d04bf39b1688385c43b40fae9444edbd9ed9190c6656ea10bf:1;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">对文物年代进行测定</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．蚕丝的主要成分为蛋白质，A错误；</p><p>B．烟花是电子从能量较高的激发态跃迁到能量较低的激发态乃至基态所致，B错误；</p><p>C．淀粉水解为葡萄糖，葡萄糖转化为乙醇涉及氧化还原反应，C正确；</p><p>D．考古利用<img src=\"chem-asset:dc8e4f7bb9276170dd1bb62a53f74ab7747c708d32391e85f733faa61c54e490:2;\" style=\"width:24.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">可以测定文物年代，D错误。</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["a8ab8898e0dd09d04bf39b1688385c43b40fae9444edbd9ed9190c6656ea10bf","bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742","dc8e4f7bb9276170dd1bb62a53f74ab7747c708d32391e85f733faa61c54e490"],"refs":{"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/b49277f17d5303975ba1eb7f.png","chem-asset:a8ab8898e0dd09d04bf39b1688385c43b40fae9444edbd9ed9190c6656ea10bf:1;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/fd9a6c00f69615fd0a78f947.png","chem-asset:dc8e4f7bb9276170dd1bb62a53f74ab7747c708d32391e85f733faa61c54e490:2;":"../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/4866180f95ebe42b62b9d344.png"},"sourceSha256":"e7cff48c8b8ae997438b3af4d85758d157bcacc8d70bf95ae3ae30c4c3ded686","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学与STSE/化学科学对人类文明发展的意义/2026.5.8/P02-Q01_湖南非遗与食品文物化学.html"},"2026.5.8:P02-Q14":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>一甲胺盐酸滴定的分布和水电离</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 麓山国际四月学情调研 · 原题14 · P02-Q14</div><h1>一甲胺盐酸滴定的分布和水电离</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/酸碱中和滴定</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：结合酸碱滴定曲线、物料守恒及电离水解常数计算。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/弱电解质的电离平衡</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/电离平衡常数和电离度</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/盐类的水解/盐类水解原理</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/水的电离</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;\" style=\"width:434.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>14. 一甲胺(<img src=\"chem-asset:8d43f053808cc52a4bb0a7da6cbf8ea74fd81b72704cf247d07ec7ebfa902856:1;\" style=\"width:61.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)在医药、农药、染料、炸药等工业领域应用广泛。<img src=\"chem-asset:0b99e5958742c99a415f0ae0124ac9f0a44270d227196af3ae96a88c8b343b52:2;\" style=\"width:37.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，向<img src=\"chem-asset:24948f7dd3e108e99281f47fde20224ce3a0ff7a92d70a8a5e2c86bd6d3516ed:3;\" style=\"width:183.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中滴加<img src=\"chem-asset:c9f59904c3e7d66e79f98dc32fb5a92a433772be266d0daca28e3928ac9a0845:4;\" style=\"width:77.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">盐酸，混合液中<img src=\"chem-asset:0d83973cbcfe3c6d23e83df95ee68f100a20829ecdcb7733452932d208c4b596:5;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:28db7a4a71c0ca3b3e68a80269c3d5488353ae9c97d749737aa397602c3a08f6:6;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的分布分数<img src=\"chem-asset:5dce807209ba781b4b5c4011595e0f9acaf77ca040763650dab7fc5a27f3d4a1:7;\" style=\"width:15.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">[<img src=\"chem-asset:0ef6665b752e63a89fc6f67cf8af16fc7398fbd4595c8ec6070d3062959d8585:8;\" style=\"width:281.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">]、水电离出的<img src=\"chem-asset:7d3d39dbe4e042105a65f1322691c8cc5864078a8f8656675160dbea4876b174:9;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">负对数<img src=\"chem-asset:6927024781f01d4c51d8a7d923128f17989c1bbd0d2926276b0249df29bfca73:10;\" style=\"width:92.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与所加盐酸体积的关系如图所示。下列叙述正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:85bf85d2cf2f0751ce9b571fe218b669cace318c6c52a9a16fcb6be7bbc1f0bd:11;\" style=\"width:301.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 曲线Ⅰ代表<img src=\"chem-asset:518416604f55c8cbb302f68c63e3e51fcaa6e8fe0946d6f56786ed60806e4cad:12;\" style=\"width:88.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的变化</p><p>B. B点溶液满足关系：<img src=\"chem-asset:c9087bbf7c435a33f9833c8f8039513833e87787219a1f56eab4d000194c6de1:13;\" style=\"width:240.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:bb118eb95ae294f28e55911b8d263394d00abce417ad131ff3939a51651b4f25:14;\" style=\"width:33.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，<img src=\"chem-asset:54025acf52a33991201b1e977f17d6e0bc294d47cb44bfd9001e81d6fa7b725d:15;\" style=\"width:262.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:9e4cda61edf74983d9768d16d3ca0d23d3db5b555c371357b535089b4c54a51d:16;\" style=\"width:64.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:36b0aa2dc06d562e4b4b362cd30e28da78a03f1804a0c92e8fec80185ac1f101:17;\" style=\"width:48.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．一甲胺溶液中加入盐酸，发生反应的化学方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:351f9a5f1bad81a9de764800bf835a526849d8a4f962a501771b8fe8be0a3a59:18;\" style=\"width:192.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，随着盐酸的滴加，<img src=\"chem-asset:0d83973cbcfe3c6d23e83df95ee68f100a20829ecdcb7733452932d208c4b596:5;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">不断被消耗，<img src=\"chem-asset:28db7a4a71c0ca3b3e68a80269c3d5488353ae9c97d749737aa397602c3a08f6:6;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">不断生成，结合图像可知，曲线Ⅰ代表<img src=\"chem-asset:ee399f238a8a45bde3479b83c489863d22aa274ee2f340019eaaac33db850d6a:19;\" style=\"width:86.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的变化，曲线Ⅱ代表<img src=\"chem-asset:518416604f55c8cbb302f68c63e3e51fcaa6e8fe0946d6f56786ed60806e4cad:12;\" style=\"width:88.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的变化，A错误；</p><p>B．B点<img src=\"chem-asset:0d83973cbcfe3c6d23e83df95ee68f100a20829ecdcb7733452932d208c4b596:5;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:bdb2bd8739e1c53f156ad2293dd8f4979b45240acf2df31a9e2046c77965365f:20;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">恰好完全反应，溶质只有<img src=\"chem-asset:46dd972f3362e169c1cabf6bc125bde72403c5a130fa405d46b16b6ee55a2523:21;\" style=\"width:77.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，根据物料守恒有<img src=\"chem-asset:c9087bbf7c435a33f9833c8f8039513833e87787219a1f56eab4d000194c6de1:13;\" style=\"width:240.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B正确；</p><p>C．由图可知，在A点，��(<img src=\"chem-asset:28db7a4a71c0ca3b3e68a80269c3d5488353ae9c97d749737aa397602c3a08f6:6;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)=��(CH<sub>3</sub>NH<sub>2</sub>)=0.5，说明<img src=\"chem-asset:a668fee96ad94b5f103e079e59f8ee2f7dfa390514dfdb59136250b1090f5dd5:22;\" style=\"width:181.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，此时由水电离出的<img src=\"chem-asset:1c5097add79802b5ac4f62c6400621a34741ab6f207667881c2ecf5e4c12a63b:23;\" style=\"width:240.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即溶液中<img src=\"chem-asset:6be28526e9e6c0f51040bb7c556293f1bfd041a41ec3b33b3d407f81f851e972:24;\" style=\"width:219.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，溶液中的<img src=\"chem-asset:85971be04659f186e423222991151c2128d0b24360873ab41737a8b29c3cbda9:25;\" style=\"width:159.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则<img src=\"chem-asset:0d83973cbcfe3c6d23e83df95ee68f100a20829ecdcb7733452932d208c4b596:5;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的电离常数<img src=\"chem-asset:2e5d20fec4ea8c564a238859c507b2178f9482e25f6e363c5e628b46577c8df3:26;\" style=\"width:22.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为<img src=\"chem-asset:166aa6499e5f528059c97d895c3707cb55fc1b1ade9f382f47389639a53e6907:27;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则<img src=\"chem-asset:28db7a4a71c0ca3b3e68a80269c3d5488353ae9c97d749737aa397602c3a08f6:6;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的水解常数<img src=\"chem-asset:31fc8523b4b92b1872fd669cb7cb962fd55e5a00610eb6d9be7697a3cf63afcc:28;\" style=\"width:167.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C错误；</p><p>D．由于<img src=\"chem-asset:0d83973cbcfe3c6d23e83df95ee68f100a20829ecdcb7733452932d208c4b596:5;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:e0de6bdbe7c7cabc07f68aef14cc5717ee07fdb978e0daad59cd64f057e6c0b4:29;\" style=\"width:97.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:c998a91166ef817b0660b3e4b1013efa498adb0b5f7feabd1a185a89d4ea0af4:30;\" style=\"width:22.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则当加入<img src=\"chem-asset:67bc61f507fdd60cb8447e41c5fb981f06cd97a2501079f2578e0a1973b8fc6a:31;\" style=\"width:120.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">盐酸，中和<img src=\"chem-asset:8173297eb07ac0ed5895aba9812aa6a9ad98f22d328d1d9a4b8a9ad1848f7e1d:32;\" style=\"width:32.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，溶液中<img src=\"chem-asset:d5f0eea4e99254502f80454746675ec1d391311ed654e428f4a17f55894ac4e5:33;\" style=\"width:181.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故当<img src=\"chem-asset:d239ca3a880ef45acfb575c26c2dcca33b5ac03e0d36037ea2fd3a929dbfa388:34;\" style=\